# Files/directories excluded from the Docker build context.
# https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file

# VCS and metadata
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.dockerignore
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.DS_Store
**/__pycache__
**/.venv

# Dependencies and build artifacts (installed/built inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.cache
**/bin
**/obj

# Docker / compose files (not needed inside the image)
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*
**/compose*
**/charts

# Logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log

# Environment files (prevent secret leakage into the build context)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Misc
LICENSE
README.md
**/secrets.dev.yaml
**/values.dev.yaml
